User sent in a message about them not being able to find Department files.

They mention that the drive letter they've previously used is gone from their computer.
Worked last week.

The user has gone through some troubleshooting and reporting the following:
- Drive letter not in This PC
- Was working last week
- Restarted my computer - still gone
- Internet seems fine

I remote into their Computer and take a look at their File explorer -> This PC and see that the
D: Engineering Department Drive is offline.

I go into the Documentation to find the information about the different servers and I locate the File server tab.
Here I find the standard shares of the different servers and copy paste the \\FILESERV01\departments\Engineering

I go back to the users Computer on remote, I click the ... and choose to Map Network Drive and copy paste the direction
I found in the documentation.

This fixed the problem! Ticket solved.
